1. DEFINITIONS

  1.1 "Project" means the ViltrumX software and every artifact in this
      repository, including source code, documentation, specifications,
      designs, diagrams, data models, and brand assets (including the
      hexagon-shield mark).

  1.2 "Concept" means the underlying idea and design of ViltrumX as
      expressed in the Project — including its product vision and
      positioning, the ontology-driven security operations model, the
      governed-autonomy ladder, the agent roster and orchestration design,
      the India-first compliance approach, the multilingual explainability
      approach, Founder Mode, and the brand identity.

  1.3 "Owner" means Yuvraj, the sole and exclusive owner of the Project
      and the Concept.

  1.4 "Contributor" means any person other than the Owner who submits,
      or has submitted, any code, documentation, design, or other material
      to the Project.

  1.5 "Contribution" means any material submitted to the Project by a
      Contributor.

